flowchart TD
    U[User]
    P1[Authentication Process]
    P2[Forest Management Process]
    P3[Species and Tree Management Process]
    P4[Incident and Patrol Process]
    P5[Environmental and Wildlife Process]
    P6[Reporting and Dashboard Process]

    D1[(User DB)]
    D2[(Forest DB)]
    D3[(Species DB)]
    D4[(Tree DB)]
    D5[(Incident DB)]
    D6[(PatrolLog DB)]
    D7[(EnvironmentalData DB)]
    D8[(Wildlife DB)]

    U -->|Register/Login| P1
    P1 <--> D1
    P1 -->|JWT/Auth result| U

    U -->|Add/View/Edit/Delete Forest| P2
    P2 <--> D2
    P2 -->|Forest data| U

    U -->|Manage Species/Trees| P3
    P3 <--> D3
    P3 <--> D4
    P3 <--> D2
    P3 -->|Species/Tree data| U

    U -->|Log Incidents/Patrol Logs| P4
    P4 <--> D5
    P4 <--> D6
    P4 <--> D2
    P4 -->|Incident/Patrol info| U

    U -->|View/Add Wildlife and Environmental Data| P5
    P5 <--> D7
    P5 <--> D8
    P5 <--> D2
    P5 -->|Monitoring data| U

    U -->|View Dashboard/Reports| P6
    P6 <--> D2
    P6 <--> D3
    P6 <--> D4
    P6 <--> D5
    P6 <--> D6
    P6 <--> D7
    P6 <--> D8
    P6 -->|Summaries/analytics| U
